\title{Asymptotic expansion}
\taxon{Definition}
\date{2023-10-01}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{If the definition of an asymptotic approximation holds for all #{N}, we say that the asymptotic approximation is called an \em{asymptotic expansion/series} and we write}

##{f(x) \sim \sum_{k=0}^\infty a_k\phi_k(x).}
